  m_text: 'PLAYER CONTROLS:

    Move - WASD + Left Ctrl Stick

    Look - Mouse
    + Right Ctrl Stick

    Zoom - Right Click + Right Ctrl Stick(Pressed)

    Crouch
    - Ctrl + Button East

    Lean Left & Right - Q/E + Left/Right Trigger

    Use
    Item - Left Click + Right Shoulder Btn

    Scroll Items - Mouse Wheel + D-PAD

    :)

